.venv/
venv/
# The venv at <repo>/simopd. Anchored: a bare `simopd/` also matches src/simopd/,
# which silently kept zmq_lane.py out of git for a day while sitecustomize imported
# it on four machines that never had it.
# Comment on its OWN lines: gitignore has no inline comments -- `#` only opens a
# comment at line start, so `/simopd/   # ...` was one literal pattern that matched
# nothing, and `git status` showed the whole 7.4G venv as untracked.
/simopd/
# Generated by setup.sh (absolute paths for this deployment); never committed.
/simopd_env.sh

